# Where the UI gets its data.
#
#   mock   the fixtures in each module's data/ — the default, and it stays the
#          default until the backend covers every screen. The fixtures are the
#          design: they encode what a finding looks like and which cases are
#          interesting, and a UI that can only run live cannot be demoed or
#          reviewed offline.
#   api    tb-helix-ai-svc — run `make hsvc` first (:9090)
VITE_DATA_SOURCE=mock

# Override only if the service is not behind the dev proxy.
# VITE_API_BASE=/api/v1
